cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this Lean formalization when using its code, and cite the article
  by Yukun He, Jiaoyang Huang, and Xiaoyu Wang for the mathematical results.
title: Bulk universality of random regular graphs in Lean
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
authors:
  - name: Bulk universality Lean contributors
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the principal bulk-universality theorem, polynomial
  mixed fourth-moment statement, and fixed-energy Gaussian Wasserstein corollary
  for uniform fixed-degree random regular graphs, with vendored local-law and
  loop-equation formalizations. The included article PDF retains its authors'
  copyright and is excluded from the software license.
